        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>线性代数手写笔记 — 行列式与矩阵</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]},\n  svg: {fontCache: 'global'}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#e9e6e0;\n    font-family:\"Kaiti SC\",\"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",\"Segoe Script\",\"Bradley Hand\",cursive,serif;\n    color:#1c2a4a;\n  }\n  .page{\n    position:relative;\n    width:540px;\n    min-height:720px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#fdfcf8;\n    background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        transparent 0px,\n        transparent 27px,\n        #cfd6dd 27px,\n        #cfd6dd 28px);\n    box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25);\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  /* left margin rule */\n  .page:before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:98px; top:0; bottom:0;\n    width:1px;\n    background:#d9b7bd;\n  }\n  .content{\n    position:relative;\n    padding:10px 12px 20px 104px;\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    line-height:28px;\n  }\n  .content p{margin:0;}\n  .ind1{padding-left:14px;}\n  .ind2{padding-left:34px;}\n  .ind3{padding-left:60px;}\n  .ind4{padding-left:86px;}\n  .ind5{padding-left:110px;}\n  .star{font-size:15px;}\n  .row{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:nowrap;}\n  .gap{display:inline-block;width:38px;}\n  .gap-s{display:inline-block;width:20px;}\n  .gap-l{display:inline-block;width:70px;}\n  .boxed{\n    border:1px solid #1c2a4a;\n    padding:0 6px;\n    display:inline-block;\n    line-height:24px;\n  }\n  .small{font-size:12.5px;line-height:20px;}\n  /* right side notes */\n  .sidenote{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:6px;\n    font-size:12px;\n    line-height:20px;\n    text-align:left;\n  }\n  .n1{top:414px;}\n  .n2{top:448px;}\n  .n3{top:470px;}\n  .arrowline{font-size:13px;}\n  .placeholder{\n    border:1px dashed #9aa4b1;\n    color:#7b8794;\n    font-size:11px;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .binder{\n    position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:16px;\n    background:linear-gradient(to right,#cfc9c0,#efeae2);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"binder\"></div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <p>4. 两个 $n$阶方阵乘积的行列式等于行列式的乘积</p>\n    <p class=\"ind1\">$|AB| = |A|\\,|B|$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind1\"><span class=\"star\">✿</span> 设$A_1,\\,A_2\\cdots,\\ A_m$ 都为$n$阶方阵，则<span class=\"gap-s\"></span>$|A_1A_2\\cdots A_m| = |A_1|\\,|A_2|\\cdots|A_m|$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind1\">推论：设 $A$ 为 $n$阶方阵，则 $|kA| = k^{\\,n}\\,|A|$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind3\">例：$A,B$为$n$阶方阵，$|A| = a \\neq 0$，若 $AB + 2E = 0$ 求$|B|$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind4\">$|AB| = |A||B| = a\\,|B| = |-2E| = (-2)^{n}$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind4\">$\\therefore\\ |B| = (-2)^{n}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{a}$</p>\n\n    <p>5. 转置矩阵记为 $A^{T}$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind1\"><span class=\"star\">☆</span>定理<span class=\"gap-s\"></span>$(A^{T})^{T} = A$<span class=\"gap-l\"></span>$(A+B)^{T} = A^{T} + B^{T}$<span class=\"gap\"></span><span class=\"boxed\">$|A| = |A^{T}|$</span></p>\n    <p class=\"ind3\">$(kA)^{T} = kA^{T}$<span class=\"gap-l\"></span>$(AB)^{T} = B^{T}A^{T}$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2\">若 $A^{T} = A$ ，则 $A$为 对称矩阵 ，若 $A^{T} = -A$，则 $A$为 反对称矩阵</p>\n\n    <p>6. 可逆矩阵：有$n$阶方阵$A,B$，使 $AB=E=BA$，则称$A$为 可逆矩阵，$B$为$A$的逆矩阵</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2\">逆矩阵是唯一的，$A$ 的唯一逆矩阵记为 $A^{-1}$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2\">证唯一：$AB = E = BA$<span class=\"gap\"></span>$AC = E = CA$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind3\">$B = BE = B(AC) = (BA)C = EC = C$<span class=\"gap-l\"></span>$=$阶伴随矩阵</p>\n\n    <p class=\"ind1\"><span class=\"star\">☆</span><span class=\"gap-s\"></span>$A^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{|A|}\\,A^{*}$<span class=\"gap\"></span>$A^{*} = \\begin{bmatrix} A_{11} &amp; A_{21} &amp; \\cdots &amp; A_{n1}\\\\ A_{12} &amp; A_{22} &amp; \\cdots &amp; A_{n2}\\\\ \\vdots &amp; \\vdots &amp; &amp; \\vdots\\\\ A_{1n} &amp; A_{2n} &amp; \\cdots &amp; A_{nn}\\end{bmatrix}$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind3 arrowline\">↑</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2 small\">伴随矩阵&nbsp;每个位置上放代数余子式再转置</p>\n\n    <p class=\"ind1\"><span class=\"star\">☆</span><span class=\"gap-s\"></span>$A\\cdot A^{*} = |A|\\cdot E = A^{*}\\cdot A.$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2\">推：$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{|A|}\\,A^{*}\\right)A = E$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2\">若$|A| = 0$，则 $|A^{*}|\\ [?]\\ 0$<span class=\"gap-l\"></span><span class=\"boxed\">$|A^{*}| = |A|^{\\,n-1}$</span><span class=\"gap-s\"></span>(1)</p>\n    <p class=\"ind1\">$A$ 可逆 $\\iff |A| \\neq 0$</p>\n    <p>性质：$|A^{-1}| = |A|^{-1}$<span class=\"gap\"></span>$(A^{T})^{-1} = (A^{-1})^{T}$</p>\n    <p class=\"ind2\">$|A^{-1}| = \\dfrac{1}{|A|}$<span class=\"gap\"></span>$(A^{-1})^{-1} = A$<span class=\"gap-s\"></span>$(kA)^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{k}A^{-1}$</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sidenote n1\">$A = \\begin{bmatrix} a &amp; b\\\\ c &amp; d\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n  <div class=\"sidenote n2\">$A^{*} = \\begin{bmatrix} d &amp; -b\\\\ -c &amp; a\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n  <div class=\"sidenote n3\">对换主线，变副对角线[?]</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
